    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589510/extras/ab6ca87c4e55c06e5ecdfecaac0097b6.poster.avif?t=1722512805\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589510/extras/ab6ca87c4e55c06e5ecdfecaac0097b6.webm?t=1722512805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>D.V. Ex Agent</strong> - <strong>is a short narrative game with horror elements. The plot of the game is intriguing, and the gameplay conveys a sense of gradual decomposition of the subconscious. The game also contains many jokes and references.</strong><br><br>&quot;Do you know what can ruin a person's life? There can be many reasons. One such reason was the events that happened to the main character.&quot;<br><br>Citizen Drankov was a respected man and worked in a secret government organization. He was trusted by the leadership, which ultimately played a cruel joke on him. You will have to go through the key moments of our hero's life. Waking up on the street near garbage cans, Drankov realizes that he remembers nothing and tries to figure out what happened. His tormented mind begins to play cruel tricks on him, and the skeletons in his closet decide to perform their sinister dance.<br><br><u><strong>Game Features:</strong></u><br><br>- Main genre: walking simulator.<br>- Gameplay recreates the realities of a person suffering from delirium.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589510/extras/5b48be9e31d4c309e9431022671398ec.poster.avif?t=1722512805\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589510/extras/5b48be9e31d4c309e9431022671398ec.webm?t=1722512805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>- The feeling of being in a parallel world, or rather in the world inside the subconscious at the terminal stage of delirium.<br>- Atmospheric sound and visual design creating a tense and mystical atmosphere.<br>- Some puzzles will really make you &quot;rack your brains,&quot; they are not easy.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589510/extras/b777608adc58ad4ac988480b0f15b2f4.poster.avif?t=1722512805\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589510/extras/b777608adc58ad4ac988480b0f15b2f4.webm?t=1722512805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>- A sad and dramatic plot filled with emotional content.<br>- And what's a game without jump scares?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589510/extras/1b6e294f6b971de5eb1cb2f658065014.poster.avif?t=1722512805\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589510/extras/1b6e294f6b971de5eb1cb2f658065014.webm?t=1722512805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><u><strong>Average playthrough time: 60 minutes</strong></u>.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589510/extras/ab6ca87c4e55c06e5ecdfecaac0097b6.poster.avif?t=1722512805\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589510/extras/ab6ca87c4e55c06e5ecdfecaac0097b6.webm?t=1722512805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>D.V. Ex Agent</strong> - <strong>is a short narrative game with horror elements. The plot of the game is intriguing, and the gameplay conveys a sense of gradual decomposition of the subconscious. The game also contains many jokes and references.</strong><br><br>&quot;Do you know what can ruin a person's life? There can be many reasons. One such reason was the events that happened to the main character.&quot;<br><br>Citizen Drankov was a respected man and worked in a secret government organization. He was trusted by the leadership, which ultimately played a cruel joke on him. You will have to go through the key moments of our hero's life. Waking up on the street near garbage cans, Drankov realizes that he remembers nothing and tries to figure out what happened. His tormented mind begins to play cruel tricks on him, and the skeletons in his closet decide to perform their sinister dance.<br><br><u><strong>Game Features:</strong></u><br><br>- Main genre: walking simulator.<br>- Gameplay recreates the realities of a person suffering from delirium.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589510/extras/5b48be9e31d4c309e9431022671398ec.poster.avif?t=1722512805\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589510/extras/5b48be9e31d4c309e9431022671398ec.webm?t=1722512805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>- The feeling of being in a parallel world, or rather in the world inside the subconscious at the terminal stage of delirium.<br>- Atmospheric sound and visual design creating a tense and mystical atmosphere.<br>- Some puzzles will really make you &quot;rack your brains,&quot; they are not easy.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589510/extras/b777608adc58ad4ac988480b0f15b2f4.poster.avif?t=1722512805\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589510/extras/b777608adc58ad4ac988480b0f15b2f4.webm?t=1722512805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>- A sad and dramatic plot filled with emotional content.<br>- And what's a game without jump scares?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589510/extras/1b6e294f6b971de5eb1cb2f658065014.poster.avif?t=1722512805\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589510/extras/1b6e294f6b971de5eb1cb2f658065014.webm?t=1722512805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><u><strong>Average playthrough time: 60 minutes</strong></u>.",
